  "slug": "lemon-herb-baked-salmon",
  "name": "Lemon herb baked salmon",
  "description": "A one-pan dinner of salmon fillets baked over roasted potato and broccoli, finished with lemon and fresh dill.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 425°F and cut the potato into thin wedges.",
    "Toss the potato and broccoli with the olive oil and garlic, then spread them across a sheet pan.",
    "Roast the potato and broccoli for 10 minutes, then move them to the edges and set the salmon skin-side down in the middle.",
    "Squeeze half the lemon over the salmon, scatter the dill across the fillets, and tuck the rest of the lemon between them.",
    "Bake 12 minutes more, until the salmon is opaque at its thickest point and gives easily under a fork."
